# Hurura'a's routes (README.md, "Routes file"): Faito's, plus pf-ui's images, which its pages load
# from absolute paths (/assets/...): on the demo host, /fr/assets/... is a file of the front end's
# container.
/           redirect  to=/fr/
/gateway/*  gateway
/fr/*       fr
/en/*       en
/assets/*   fr        prefix=/fr
